        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of ping deciding who gets to shoot first? Tired of your opponent drawing the perfect card and winning the game? Tired of re-rolling tirelessly for items that never appear?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coin Flippin' seeks to cut all of the frustrating chance out of modern gaming and finally be upfront about your odds of winning. Traverse the levels of the mysterious tower one by one with the surety of knowing that every time you flip that coin, you have the fairest odds of winning possible: 50/50.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>WHAT TO EXPECT:</strong></u><br>Seven floors. Seven coinflips. One coinflip per floor, and that's it. No fat and no fluff, this game is as simple as it gets. In this third person top-down super simplistic roguelike, you'll progress through the seven levels of the tower one flip at a time. Correctly guess heads or tails seven times in a row and you'll reach the top of the tower. Your first run could be your win, so may the odds be in your favor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063650/extras/660e5ee07c295b99e263d21e25885489.avif?t=1762491782\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of ping deciding who gets to shoot first? Tired of your opponent drawing the perfect card and winning the game? Tired of re-rolling tirelessly for items that never appear?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coin Flippin' seeks to cut all of the frustrating chance out of modern gaming and finally be upfront about your odds of winning. Traverse the levels of the mysterious tower one by one with the surety of knowing that every time you flip that coin, you have the fairest odds of winning possible: 50/50.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>WHAT TO EXPECT:</strong></u><br>Seven floors. Seven coinflips. One coinflip per floor, and that's it. No fat and no fluff, this game is as simple as it gets. In this third person top-down super simplistic roguelike, you'll progress through the seven levels of the tower one flip at a time. Correctly guess heads or tails seven times in a row and you'll reach the top of the tower. Your first run could be your win, so may the odds be in your favor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063650/extras/660e5ee07c295b99e263d21e25885489.avif?t=1762491782\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p>",
